      ['03 · GOVERN','Who may say, approve, reuse, and retain what?','Define scope of services, spokesperson authority, substantiation, review time, confidential information, identity and image permissions, media and territory, archive copies, post-term use, credit, correction, takedown, and termination from the actual agreement.','INFERENCE',['S78']],
      ['04 · REMEMBER','What enters the institutional record?','Preserve final releases, pitches where appropriate, media lists under proper privacy controls, approvals, corrections, placements, refusals, captions, credits, rights evidence, and decision context. The archive should record how public meaning was made—not only the resulting coverage.','PROPOSAL',['S39','S80']]
